    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "\n\n\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Dragonmarked Scion Dedication</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The well of power that you draw from your dragonmark grows deeper. You increase the size of your focus pool by 1. In addition, you may pick another dragonmark focus spell from your list. This spell can be up to the maximum level you can currently cast.  <br /><br /><strong>Special</strong> you may pick this feat multiple times, each time picking a different focus spell.</p>\n"
